  "historyNote": "#6356, eff 10-22-96; amd by #7814, eff 1-3-03; ss by #8162, eff 9-9-04; ss by #8367, eff 6-2-05; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17",
