  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw3000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Sw 3001.05 Validation Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 3001.05 Validation Requirements.\n\n(a) A winning ticket shall be eligible to receive a prize if the following are true:\n\n(1) The winning ticket shall have been issued from an on-line terminal by an authorized lottery agent;\n\n(2) The winning ticket information shall have been recorded in the central computer system at least 59 minutes prior to the drawing;\n\n(3) All information appearing on the winning ticket shall correspond precisely with the commission’s computer record;\n\n(4) The 15 or 16 digit validation number and bar code shall appear in its entirety;\n\n(5) The winning ticket shall be intact, fully legible and correspond to the art work on file at the commission;\n\n(6) The ticket shall not be defectively printed, fuzzy, unreadable, blank or partially blank, or defective; and\n\n(7) The ticket shall not be counterfeit in whole or in part, altered, reconstructed, tampered with in any manner, stolen or misregistered.\n\nSource. #6356, eff 10-22-96; amd by #7814, eff 1-3-03; ss by #8162, eff 9-9-04; ss by #8367, eff 6-2-05; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw3000.html"
